            <ArticleTitle>Delayed resolution of obstructing thrombus following acute closure.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>230-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A case of acute thrombotic closure following percutaneous coronary angioplasty demonstrating delayed clearance of obstructing thrombus is reported. Although common in other clinical scenarios this has not been reported following coronary angioplasty.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
